@startuml robustness-uc11
title 图 2-14 UC-11 审核处方通过 · 鲁棒图

skinparam {
  DefaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
  DefaultFontSize 12
  shadowing false
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}

object "药师\n（参与者）" as ACT <<actor>>
object "药师审方页\nPharmacistReviewPage" as B_REVIEW <<boundary>>
object "PrescriptionReviewAppService\n（审方应用服务）" as C_REVIEW <<control>>
object "PrescriptionStateMachine\n（处方状态机）" as C_SM <<control>>
object "Prescription\n（处方）" as E_PRE <<entity>>
object "ReviewRecord\n（审方记录）" as E_REC <<entity>>
object "AuditLog\n（审计日志）" as E_AUDIT <<entity>>

ACT --> B_REVIEW : 1. 打开待审队列并选择处方
B_REVIEW --> C_REVIEW : 2. approve(prescriptionId, version)
C_REVIEW --> E_PRE : 3. 加载处方并确认状态为待审核
C_REVIEW --> C_SM : 4. assertCanApprove(status, version)
C_REVIEW --> E_PRE : 5. 状态改为待核销，有效期 = now + 3 天
C_REVIEW --> E_REC : 6. 写审方记录（APPROVED）
C_REVIEW --> E_AUDIT : 7. 写审计日志（审核人、时间）
C_REVIEW --> B_REVIEW : 8. 返回审方结果

note right of C_REVIEW
  审核通过即对患者产生取药承诺，
  之后不能回退到待审核 / 已驳回；
  需要撤销只能走「作废」并留痕。
end note
@enduml
